\title{Formalising the Stack}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2026-08-18}
\meta{toc}{true}

\p{
    My own work, and the reason for the rest of this corpus. The [verified zkEVM](https://verified-zkevm.org) effort runs three tracks — the zkVM constraints, the EVM semantics, and the cryptography — and I sit in the cryptography track, on [ArkLib](dhsorens-0040) and [CompPoly](dhsorens-0041).
}

\p{
    These pages should stay closer to the code than the rest of the corpus, and they are the ones most likely to go stale. Related: [protocol snarkification](dhsorens-0020), [computable specifications](dhsorens-0025), [formal verification in proof assistants](dhsorens-0015).
}

